---
description: >-
  Twin of label-syntax.mmd with markdownAlwaysOn (#1368, #1397): every packet label is
  markdown, so the plain `**bold** _ital_` rows draw bold and italic and the code-span row draws
  inline code, unlike label-syntax.mmd. A markdown string, tags and a written `\n` draw as in
  the default mode.
config:
  markdownAlwaysOn: true
---
packet
  title "`title **bold** _ital_`"
  0-31: "field **bold** _ital_"
  32-63: "`field **bold** _ital_`"
  64-95: "field a `code` b"
  96-127: "field <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  128-159: "field one\ntwo"
